# CHRVVIM Campus — primary site redirects
# Source of truth for the consolidated primary deployment.
# Order matters: first match wins (Netlify processes top-down).
# `!` forces the rule even when a real file exists at the path.

# Admin console: pretty URL -> actual file (forced, permanent)
/admin            /admin.html    301!

# Back-compat aliases for the legacy /public/* source layout (live site serves both)
/public/documents/*  /documents/:splat   200
/public/assets/*     /assets/:splat      200

# SPA fallback for unknown paths (returns the app shell with a 404 status)
/*  /index.html  404
